{"id":"665157","name":"凉拌土豆丝","author":"青梅果果儿","authorId":"11412049","desc":"","cover":"images/665157/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"三个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"一颗"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"两颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备三个小土豆削皮。","img":"images/665157/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆搽成丝，刀工好的可以切成丝。","img":"images/665157/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水。","img":"images/665157/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放土豆丝。","img":"images/665157/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"开水烫两分钟(看自己喜欢的速度，喜欢熟一点的可以烫五六分钟)。","img":"images/665157/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备点小葱花和香菜切好。","img":"images/665157/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放酱油，生抽，香菜，香葱。","img":"images/665157/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"盐，味精，五滴香油，花椒油。","img":"images/665157/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放一首自己练的辣椒油。","img":"images/665157/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/665157/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"快来炫两口。","img":"images/665157/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"烫土豆丝不要超过十分钟，太软了，会断口感不好。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}